{
  "id": "17k.com",
  "name": "17K小说网（正版）",
  "enabled": true,
  "free_only": true,
  "predecode": false,
  "requires_js": true,
  "fetch_mode": "browser",
  "demo_url": "https://www.17k.com/book/3631088.html",
  "notes": "阿里云 WAF（acw_tc / acw_sc__v2）—— 纯 HTTP 拿到的是 JS 挑战页（aliyunwaf_* script），故走浏览器路由。实测（2026-09-20，《师弟，你的丹药太不正经了》586 章）：\n\n· 目录在 /list/{bid}.html 的 `<dl class=\"Volume\"><dd><a href=\"/chapter/{bid}/{cid}.html\">`；本书 586 章**全免费**，目录里没有任何 VIP class（只有 span.ellipsis），故本规则的 VIP 判定靠第 4 层兜底。\n· 章节页正文在 div#readAreaBox；**无字体反爬**（PUA=0 / 无 @font-face）。\n· **VIP 信号在 CSS**：免费章加载 chapter_free.css，付费章应为 chapter_vip.css —— 已写进 chapter.vip_markers，配合 check_page_markers 在整页 HTML 上判定（正文里不含该字样）。\n\n注意：网上流传的 17K 书号多为失效（实测 3220540 返回「您的访问出错了」）；本规则的 demo 书号是 2026-09-20 从首页实测取的。",
  "match": [
    "17k.com"
  ],
  "book": {
    "url_pattern": "/(?:book|list|chapter)/(\\d+)",
    "info_url": "{origin}/book/{bid}.html",
    "title": [
      "@title",
      ".book-info h1",
      "h1"
    ],
    "title_pattern": "^(.*?)_",
    "author": [
      ".author a",
      ".book-info .author a",
      "a[href*='/author/']"
    ],
    "intro": [
      "meta[name='description']",
      ".intro",
      "#bookIntro"
    ],
    "cover": [
      "meta[property='og:image']",
      ".book-cover img"
    ],
    "status": []
  },
  "browser": {
    "wait_ms": 2500
  },
  "catalog": {
    "pages": {
      "mode": "single",
      "url": "{origin}/list/{bid}.html"
    },
    "item_selector": "dl.Volume dd a[href*='/chapter/']",
    "id_from": {
      "mode": "href",
      "pattern": "/chapter/\\d+/(?P<cid>\\d+)\\.html"
    },
    "sort": "cid_numeric_asc",
    "dedupe": "keep_first",
    "volume_selector": null,
    "browser_wait_selector": "dl.Volume dd a[href*='/chapter/']"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "title_selector": "h1, .readAreaTitle, .chapterTitle",
    "content_selector": "div#readAreaBox",
    "strip_selectors": [
      "script",
      "style",
      "h1",
      "h2",
      ".chapter_update_time",
      ".chapter_text_ad",
      ".read_tit",
      ".nextChapter",
      ".preChapter",
      ".readAreaBoxTip",
      "div.ad"
    ],
    "vip_markers": [
      "chapter_vip",
      "VIP章节",
      "本章为付费",
      "订阅本章",
      "购买本章",
      "余额不足"
    ],
    "ad_patterns": [
      "17K小说网",
      "17k.com",
      "请记住本站",
      "本章未完",
      "求收藏",
      "求推荐票",
      "手机用户请浏览"
    ],
    "browser_wait_selector": "div.readAreaBox, div#readAreaBox, div#readArea",
    "content_selectors": [
      "div#readAreaBox",
      "div.readAreaBox",
      "div#readArea"
    ]
  }
}